5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to check if we are repeating past mistakes before we commit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Who is actually going to run this? The crews are stretched thin.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry we are fixing the wrong part of the journey again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to know who else has to say yes before we start.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Let us look at the numbers that actually bind us, not the headlines.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, the roster books might show if we have any slack left.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. If the late-turn pool is empty, nothing works.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, maybe the journey audits will show where the time really goes.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the committee minutes to see who holds the pen.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the capital ledger balances to see what is truly available.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I will also look at the two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the crew establishment and maintenance contract details.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will also look at the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let us see what the data says before we argue.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic over enthusiasm, please.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope the stopwatch tells the truth this time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Peace of mind comes from knowing the ground is solid.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
