35,2,1,talk,May,,"The ferry trial worked fine, but the late-evening pilot hit its cost target.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The late-turn pool is nearly empty. Overtime is covering everything.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Timed runs are slower, but crowds clear at the old rate.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance, but operating funds are trimmed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the pool is empty, how do we extend night service?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,We can't. The crews are a third below establishment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, the audits say waiting for connections is the real time sink.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, if the data terms aren't agreed, how do we integrate fares?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The ticketing fees exceed the paving budget. That is a problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"So the pilots suggest night service is viable, but staffing is the blocker.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. The maintenance contract has spare capacity, but the people don't.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The mid-city route is slow, but the stations aren't the bottleneck.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The pre-war shells have heavy contingency pricing. That delays station work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The ring-fenced money is for construction, not operations.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,We need a plan that doesn't rely on new crews.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Or a plan that accepts the current limits.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let us focus on where the minutes actually go.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us avoid the traps in the old shells.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us stay within the real budget.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
